          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ошибка (oshíbka) comes from ошибиться, \"to make a mistake\", first \"to miss, to strike past the target\", from шибать, \"to strike\" (Vasmer)."
